  "description": "Permanent enchantments are improvements to an existing owned item. Successful checks apply the declared compatible ordinary enchantment; excess successes may add or rank up qualities and a successful Skill-Check Surge unlocks one exceptional quality. Points always add to the base equipped item and do not cost XP. Craftsmanship and enchanting share ranked caps, without duplicating the same named improvement.",
